flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> A

    A["Step 1 -- Authenticate to Catalyst Center<br/>POST /dna/system/api/v1/auth/token<br/>Store short-lived JWT -> _catc_token"]
    A --> AC{Auth<br/>successful?}
    AC -->|No| FAIL_AUTH([Fail: authentication failed<br/>Check dnac_username / dnac_password])
    AC -->|Yes| B

    B["Step 2 -- Load input data<br/>Resolve settings_json_path relative -> absolute<br/>lookup file -> from_json -> settings_data"]
    B --> BC{project key<br/>exists and non-empty?}
    BC -->|No| FAIL_JSON([Fail: invalid input JSON<br/>missing or empty project list])
    BC -->|Yes| C

    C["Step 3 -- Build per-site device map<br/>Walk every project entry with a non-empty device_list<br/>Reconstruct site path from HierarchyParent/Area/Bldg/Floor<br/>Group management IPs by site path<br/>Result: site_path -> ip1, ip2, ..."]
    C --> CC{site device map<br/>non-empty?}
    CC -->|No| FAIL_MAP([Fail: no entries with device_list<br/>found in input JSON])
    CC -->|Yes| PA

    PA["Phase A -- include_tasks per site<br/>loop _site_device_map | dict2items<br/>tasks/provision_site.yml"]
    PA --> D

    D["Step A -- Resolve site UUID<br/>GET /dna/intent/api/v1/site?name=full_hierarchy_path<br/>Extract response[0].id -> _site_uuid"]
    D --> DC{site found<br/>in CatC?}
    DC -->|No| FAIL_SITE([Fail: site not found<br/>create site hierarchy first])
    DC -->|Yes| E

    E["Step B -- Resolve device UUIDs<br/>GET /dna/intent/api/v1/network-device<br/>?managementIpAddress=ip  once per IP<br/>Build IP -> uuid, hostname map -> _device_uuid_map"]
    E --> EC{all IPs resolved<br/>to device UUIDs?}
    EC -->|No| FAIL_DEV([Fail: device IP not found<br/>ensure device is discovered and managed])
    EC -->|Yes| F

    F["Step C -- Check already-provisioned state<br/>GET /dna/intent/api/v1/sda/provisionDevices<br/>?siteId=_site_uuid&amp;limit=500<br/>Build _already_provisioned_ids list<br/>Build networkDeviceId -> record.id map for PUT"]
    F --> PB

    PB["Phase B -- Classify, submit, poll<br/>Build POST/PUT/skip payloads then submit"]
    PB --> G

    G{For each target device:<br/>classification?}
    G -->|Not provisioned| G_POST["Add to _provision_payload<br/>networkDeviceId, siteId"]
    G -->|Already provisioned<br/>force_reprovision=true| G_PUT["Add to _reprovision_payload<br/>id, networkDeviceId, siteId"]
    G -->|Already provisioned<br/>force_reprovision=false| G_SKIP["Add to _skipped_ips<br/>log skip message"]

    G_POST --> H
    G_PUT --> H
    G_SKIP --> H

    H{any devices<br/>to submit?}
    H -->|No - all skipped| PC

    H -->|POST payload non-empty| H_POST["Submit POST provision request<br/>POST /dna/intent/api/v1/sda/provisionDevices<br/>body _provision_payload<br/>returns async taskId -> _provision_task_id"]
    H -->|PUT payload non-empty| H_PUT["Submit PUT re-provision request<br/>PUT /dna/intent/api/v1/sda/provisionDevices<br/>body _reprovision_payload includes id<br/>returns async taskId -> _reprovision_task_id"]

    H_POST --> I
    H_PUT --> I

    I["Step F -- Poll async task(s) to completion<br/>GET /dna/intent/api/v1/task/taskId<br/>retry until endTime defined or isError=true<br/>POST task and PUT task polled independently"]
    I --> IC{"task(s)<br/>successful?"}
    IC -->|isError=true| FAIL_TASK([Fail: provisioning task error<br/>failureReason reported in play output])
    IC -->|endTime defined| PC

    PC["Phase C -- Summary and next site<br/>per-site reporting then loop"]
    PC --> J

    J["Step G -- Summary per site<br/>Status: SUCCESS / FAILURE / SKIPPED<br/>New POST: N device(s)<br/>Reprov PUT: N device(s)<br/>Skipped: N device(s) -- already provisioned<br/>POST/PUT task IDs and progress logged"]
    J --> K

    K["Step H -- Query and display child task results<br/>Extract child task UUIDs from parent task progress<br/>GET /dna/intent/api/v1/task/childId for each<br/>Display per-device hostname and provisioning status"]
    K --> MORE

    MORE{more sites<br/>to process?}
    MORE -->|Yes| PA
    MORE -->|No| DONE

    DONE([Summary -- N devices provisioned / reprovisioned / skipped])

    style FAIL_AUTH fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style FAIL_JSON fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style FAIL_MAP  fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style FAIL_SITE fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style FAIL_DEV  fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style FAIL_TASK fill:#c0392b,color:#fff,stroke:#922b21
    style DONE  fill:#27ae60,color:#fff,stroke:#1e8449
    style START fill:#2980b9,color:#fff,stroke:#1a5276
    style PA fill:#8e44ad,color:#fff,stroke:#6c3483
    style PB fill:#16a085,color:#fff,stroke:#0e6655
    style PC fill:#e67e22,color:#fff,stroke:#ba6913
